{"code":"101240","name":"씨큐브","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 2000년 진주광택안료를 생산하는 부품소재 전문기업으로 설립되어 2011년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 운모제품, 전기·전자용, 화장품용, 자동차용 안료 제조 및 판매업을 영위하며, 적용분야는 산업용, 자동차용, 화장품용으로 분류됨. 진주광택안료에 알루미늄 페이스트 기술을 접목한 컬러 알루미늄 신규사업을 추진하고, 글로벌 영업 네트워크 구축과 신제품 론칭으로 시장 경쟁력을 강화하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":3095.0,"open":3075.0,"high":3175.0,"low":3065.0,"volume":11717,"amount":36264115.0,"ret_1d":0.6504,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":3.5541,"ret_5":-2.5197,"ret_20":-8.432,"ret_60":3.3389,"ret_120":-27.6869,"ret_250":-34.7734,"ma20":3226.5,"ma60":3324.5833,"ma120":3357.0417,"ma200":3610.875,"close_vs_ma200":-14.2867,"close_vs_ma60":-6.9056,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-5.1483,"r2_60":0.0041,"slope_120":-22.2573,"r2_120":0.1354,"slope_250":-30.5184,"r2_250":0.6865,"high52":4790.0,"low52":2680.0,"pos_52w":19.6682,"dd_52w":-35.3862,"mdd_1y":-39.7667,"atr14_pct":5.8274,"vol_ann_60":37.3789,"vol_avg20":7315.4,"vol_ratio20":1.6017,"vr5":0.3247,"vr20":0.0803,"amount_avg5":22366565.0,"amount_avg20":23657433.5,"amount_avg60":75218308.5,"obv_chg20":21.9633,"turnover_20":1.2883,"pv_eff_20":-6.5452,"rsi14":39.0276,"frgn_net_5":12586.0,"inst_net_5":-300.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.1108,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0026,"smart_net_5_pct":0.1082,"frgn_net_20":18923.0,"inst_net_20":13315.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.1666,"inst_net_20_pct":0.1172,"smart_net_20_pct":0.2839,"frgn_net_60":-50760.0,"inst_net_60":155396.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.4469,"inst_net_60_pct":1.3683,"smart_net_60_pct":0.9213,"frgn_net_120":147795.0,"inst_net_120":-108560.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":1.3014,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.9559,"smart_net_120_pct":0.3455,"foreign_ratio":15.45,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.56,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":55.0,"op_margin_q":27.2277,"op_qoq":83.3333,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":52.7778,"rev_yoy":26.25,"op_trend_4q":36.0976,"fin_period":"202606","roe":10.38,"debt_ratio":19.23,"per":3.08,"pbr":0.